34,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"Listen up! I've got a huge lead. I'm the Seer, and I checked Midori last night. She's the werewolf! We found the monster already, so let's not waste any time. Everyone, vote for Midori!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Servas,,"My goodness, Takumi! To find the truth so swiftly is a blessing. @Midori, this is a heavy accusation to bear. Do you have anything to say in your defense before we consider the vote?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Midori,,"@Takumi, what?! I can't believe you'd say that! I've been trying so hard to keep us all together and be supportive. I'm just a villager! Please, everyone, don't believe him!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, claiming the Seer role so early is a bold move. It could be a genuine discovery or a calculated lie to force an execution. @Midori, your reaction is emotional, which is expected, but provides no evidence. I need to weigh the probability.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"@Takumi, claiming the Seer role immediately is a high-risk strategy. If you are lying, you've painted a target on yourself. However, @Midori's denial is purely emotional. I need to determine if this is a genuine discovery or a frame.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Toshio @Ryuji, stop overthinking it! I'm not lying! I saw it with my own eyes—well, my powers! Midori is the wolf! Why are you guys protecting her by doubting me? Just vote her out and we win!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Ryuji"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Servas,,"It is a difficult position to be in, but we must trust the process. @Toshio, @Ryuji, while caution is wise, ignoring a direct claim may be a mistake. @Midori, your kindness is known, but the truth can be surprising. What say you?","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Ryuji"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Takumi, why are you being so mean? I've done nothing but be kind to everyone! I'm truly just a villager. Please, @Toshio, @Ryuji, you know I wouldn't lie to you. I'm scared... please don't let him trick you!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Toshio"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Midori, your plea for trust based on kindness is exactly what I meant by emotional appeals. It doesn't disprove the Seer's claim. @Takumi, if you are the wolf, this is a very aggressive play. I am still calculating the risks.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Takumi, if you are the Seer, the logic is simple: Midori is the wolf. If you are the wolf, you are attempting to eliminate a villager. However, @Midori's reliance on emotional pleas is logically insufficient to counter a role claim.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Toshio @Ryuji, you're still talking about ""risks"" and ""probabilities"" while the wolf is sitting right there! I'm the Seer! I'm telling you the truth! If you don't vote Midori now, you're basically helping the werewolf! Stop being so stubborn and just trust me!","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Ryuji"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Servas,,"The tension is rising, but let us not let it blind us. @Toshio, @Ryuji, if Takumi is indeed the Seer, every moment we hesitate is a gift to the wolf. Is the risk of a mistake greater than the risk of inaction?","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Ryuji"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Servas, thank you for your kindness. @Toshio, @Ryuji, please look at the facts! Takumi is being so aggressive; isn't that more suspicious? I'm just a villager who wants us all to survive. Please, don't let him manipulate you!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Toshio"",""Ryuji"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Midori, your attempt to shift suspicion onto Takumi's personality rather than his claim is a common defensive tactic. @Takumi's aggression is consistent with his character. Logically, the Seer's claim is the only concrete lead we have. I am leaning toward voting Midori.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Toshio, I agree. @Midori's defense lacks any logical counter-argument to the Seer's claim. While @Takumi's manner is abrasive, the most rational course of action is to trust the role claim over an emotional denial. I will vote for Midori.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Midori"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"Finally! I knew you guys would get there eventually. Now stop talking and just do it! Midori, you're going down! Everyone, vote for Midori right now so we can end this!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Servas,,"It seems the path is clear. While it pains me to see such discord, the logic of our friends and Takumi's conviction lead us to one conclusion. @Midori, I am sorry, but we must follow the evidence. I shall vote for you.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Midori,,"Please, I'm begging you! This is all a mistake! I've only wanted the best for everyone. If you execute me, you're killing an innocent person. Please, just think one more time! I'm not the werewolf!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Midori, your pleas are consistent, but they offer no evidence. @Takumi's claim is the only piece of information we have. To ignore it would be illogical. I will vote for Midori.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
53,1,4,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
54,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"The conclusion is inevitable. @Midori, your inability to provide a logical rebuttal to the Seer's claim makes your position untenable. I will cast my vote for you to ensure the village's safety.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
